apaTables bundles the apaquarto Quarto extension in
inst/_extensions/wjschne/apaquarto/.

apaquarto
  Copyright (c) W. Joel Schneider
  https://github.com/wjschne/apaquarto
  Licence: CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication)
  CC0 requires no attribution; the author is nonetheless credited in
  DESCRIPTION's Authors@R with the 'ctb' role as a courtesy ('cph' would
  be inaccurate -- a CC0 dedication retains no copyright to hold).
  Local modifications are listed in
  inst/_extensions/wjschne/apaquarto/PATCHES.md, including to the bundled
  Word reference document apaquarto.docx (word/styles.xml gains six
  character/paragraph styles for the Phase 1.6a table emitter, its existing
  Table style gains a run-properties override setting 10 pt type, four more
  table styles -- Table9/Table8/Table7/Table6 -- carry the D38 shrink
  ladder's smaller sizes selected per table by the new apatablesize.lua
  filter, and (D39) the Table style and its four shrink-ladder clones have
  their fixed per-cell padding (<w:tblCellMar>) cut from 58 to 15 twips per
  side -- see PATCHES.md's manual addenda, since apaquarto.docx is binary
  and outside what dev/sync-apaquarto.R can diff). They are carried in this
  package only; they have not been offered to the upstream project, and
  nothing here has been contributed back to it.

