  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/
  ATTRIBUTION IS A CONDITION OF THIS LICENCE, unlike the CC0 dedication
  above, so the author is named here AND credited in DESCRIPTION's
  Authors@R with 'ctb' and 'cph' roles. The style file names him in its
